config FINGERPRINT_ET512
	tristate "Egis ET512 fingerprint sensor"
	depends on OF && GPIOLIB
	select FINGERPRINT_ID
	help
	  Say Y here to enable support for the Egis ET512 fingerprint
	  sensor. The driver provides the esfp0 character device and the
	  navigation input interface used by the fingerprint service. It
	  also handles sensor reset and interrupt notification through the
	  platform GPIOs described by the device tree.
